    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my 7yo daughter has been asking a lot of questions about gender and pronouns lately... like she keeps seeing stuff online and asking if people can just be whatever they want. how can i explain the concept of gender identity to her in a way that is age-appropriate and \"correct\"?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
