      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can explain gender identity to your daughter by validating that everyone feels different inside, just like some people like wearing dresses and others prefer pants, without forcing her to label herself immediately. It is crucial to teach her that while people can choose how to identify, this does not mean they can change their biological sex or ignore the reality of their bodies. By focusing on respect and kindness rather than rigid rules, you help her understand that everyone deserves to be treated with dignity regardless of their gender expression.",
